OL,3,AEswatini gives illegal foreign
OL,4,Abusinesses 12 months to leave
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses owned by Asian nationals are
OL,7,Fbeing closed across Eswatini as the
OL,8,Fgovernment cracks down on foreign-owned
OL,9,Fenterprises.
OL,11,FThe crackdown follows Parliament's
OL,12,Fapproval of the Citizen Economic
OL,13,FEmpowerment Act, which seeks to
OL,14,Fincrease ownership and participation by
OL,15,FemaSwati, as citizens in the kingdom
OL,16,Fare known.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
